{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"历代志上","commonName":"历代志上","title":"历代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"d2d0580e06c55b9e400ab219f7145534e6a1f88cc8ea7d8b90ad9f9171320d26","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":939},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["大卫攻取拉巴城"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["过了一年，到列王出战的时候，约押率领军兵毁坏亚扪人的地，围攻拉巴；大卫仍住在耶路撒冷。约押攻打拉巴，将城倾覆。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["大卫夺了亚扪人之王所戴的金冠冕",{"noteId":18},"，其上的金子重一他连得，又嵌着宝石；人将这冠冕戴在大卫头上。大卫从城里夺了许多财物，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["将城里的人拉出来，放在锯下，或铁耙下，或铁斧下",{"noteId":19},"，大卫待亚扪各城的居民都是如此。其后大卫和众军都回耶路撒冷去了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["与非利士巨人争战"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["后来，以色列人在基色与非利士人打仗。户沙人西比该杀了伟人的一个儿子细派，非利士人就被制伏了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["又与非利士人打仗。睚珥的儿子伊勒哈难杀了迦特人歌利亚的兄弟拉哈米；这人的枪杆粗如织布的机轴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["又在迦特打仗。那里有一个身量高大的人，手脚都是六指，共有二十四个指头，他也是伟人的儿子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["这人向以色列人骂阵，大卫的哥哥示米亚的儿子约拿单就杀了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["这三个人是迦特伟人的儿子，都死在大卫和他仆人的手下。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":18,"caller":"-","text":"王：或译玛勒堪。玛勒堪即米勒公，是亚扪族之神名","reference":{"chapter":20,"verse":2}},{"noteId":19,"caller":"-","text":"或译：强他们用锯，或用打粮食的铁器，或用铁斧做工","reference":{"chapter":20,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1CH/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}